<title>BELGIUM: EU cereals experts to discuss food aid.</title>
<headline>EU cereals experts to discuss food aid.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union cereals experts will on Thursday discuss national contributions to the EU food aid scheme and set refunds for food aid for December, an EU official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;There will be a general discussion on national aids and a vote is expected setting refunds for December,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>--Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
